msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Minori「That's enough, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya es suficiente, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's enough?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Suficiente de qué?」"

msgid "Minori「I understand what you're trying to say.＿And I fully understand that you're＿speaking out of concern for Taiga.」"
msgstr "Minori「Entiendo lo que intentas decir. Y＿comprendo del todo que lo dices porque＿te preocupas por Taiga.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Does that mean you've come around?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eso significa que cambiaste de idea?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「In that case, well, let's leave it at that＿for...... Ugh, I just can't.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En ese caso, bueno, dejémoslo así＿por...... Agh, simplemente no puedo.」"

msgid "Minori「Can't what?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿No puedes qué?」"

msgid "Minori「............」"
msgstr "Minori「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I won't ask you to rethink your answer.＿Go ahead and shoot me down.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No te pediré que cambies tu respuesta.＿Adelante, recházame.」"

msgid "Minori「......Alright. But first, Takasu-kun, I have＿a favor to ask.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Está bien. Pero antes, Takasu-kun,＿tengo un favor que pedirte.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What is it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Qué es?」"

msgid "Minori「Takasu-kun, on Christmas Eve, before＿you met with me, you were probably＿with Taiga. Do you remember that?」"
msgstr "Minori「Takasu-kun, en Nochebuena, antes＿de verte conmigo, seguro estuviste＿con Taiga. ¿Recuerdas eso?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......No.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No.」"

msgid "Minori「I see...... Listen, Takasu-kun. Taiga＿really regrets what happened.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya veo...... Escucha, Takasu-kun. Taiga＿se arrepiente mucho de lo que pasó.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Regrets it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Se arrepiente?」"

msgid "Minori「Yeah. I don't know what happened. All I＿know is, it made Taiga a sobbing＿wreck. So......」"
msgstr "Minori「Sí. No sé qué pasó. Solo sé que＿dejó a Taiga hecha un mar de＿lágrimas. Así que......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Minori「After that, I'll listen to you.」"
msgstr "Minori「Después de eso, te escucharé.」"

msgid "Minori「......That's all, folks! Kushieda's going＿home. Ta-ta.」"
msgstr "Minori「......¡Eso es todo, amigos! Kushieda＿se va a casa. ¡Nos vemos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Minori「That's a different story. But I can at＿least understand. That much I'm＿capable of. I'm not sure if I'll change」"
msgstr "Minori「Eso ya es otra historia. Pero al menos＿puedo entenderlo. De eso sí soy capaz.＿Aunque no estoy segura de cambiar」"

msgid "Minori「my mind, though.」"
msgstr "Minori「de opinión.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......If only for appearances, would you＿please let me tell you what I wanted to＿say back then? If I don't, I won't be」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Aunque sea por las apariencias,＿¿me dejas decirte lo que quería decir＿entonces? Si no, no podré mostrarle la」"

msgid "Ryuuji「able to show my face to Taiga.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「cara a Taiga.」"

msgid "Minori「Please, Takasu-kun. Do whatever you＿can to remember what happened.＿Then I want you to think about why」"
msgstr "Minori「Por favor, Takasu-kun. Haz lo que＿puedas por recordar qué pasó. Luego＿quiero que pienses por qué」"

msgid "Minori「Taiga's talking about self-reliance.」"
msgstr "Minori「Taiga habla de valerse por sí misma.」"
